UPSTREAM ATTRIBUTION  (binding, not optional)
----------------------------------------------
The Geopolitical Risk indices are CC BY and REQUIRE attribution. Any use or
redistribution of this project's derived data carries that obligation forward:

  Caldara, Dario and Matteo Iacoviello (2022), "Measuring Geopolitical Risk,"
  American Economic Review, 112(4), pp. 1194-1225.

  Caldara, Dario, Sarah Conlisk, Matteo Iacoviello and Maddie Penn (2023),
  "Do Geopolitical Risks Raise or Lower Inflation?"

  Data downloaded from https://www.matteoiacoviello.com/gpr.htm on 2026-08-31.

Trade weights derive from UN Comtrade via the World Bank WITS API.
Country polygons are Natural Earth (public domain).
This project is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, any of the above.
